  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xEE63" flags="0x0">
    <title>Rev Limit - Fuel Cut (0x934E)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x934E; 2 rows x 2 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Engine-speed fuel-cut hysteresis table consumed directly by FUN 0004f282. Bit 4 of ffff2468 selects column 0 or 1; row 0 is the activation threshold and row 1 is the release threshold. State bit 2 of ffff2497 is returned as a Boolean and reaches aggregate six-channel fuel-output inhibit builder 0004ed88. The active stock 2x2 cells decode to Normal Cut 7650 RPM, Reverse Cut 7450 RPM, Normal Restore 7450 RPM, and Reverse Restore 4600 RPM. ROM8[00008b38]=0x63 keeps the alternate words at 00009356/00009358 outside the stock path. Code proves the operational fuel-output state and table layout; axis labels and RPM multiplier come from the public HR A2L catalog plus the native speed-domain conversion and remain candidate pending hardware validation.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="8" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>State</units>
