  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xB463" flags="0x0">
    <title>High Detonation Ignition Timing Map Knock Window (0x9B1A bit7)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x9B1A; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. High Detonation Ignition Timing Map: additive correction of calculated MBT in high-detonation mode; the low 7 bits carry a signed-offset quantity, while bit 7 carries a knock-window flag. This view edits mask 0x80 and preserves the other bits in each cell. Code leaves 0x9b1a selected while the high-detonation branch is active and uses shared input 0x26230. The physical name and scale match homolog EV18A 0x9b76 with the shared layout offset of +0x5c.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="11" />
