  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xCF54" flags="0x0">
    <title>Stationary Rev Limiter Accumulator Step (0x124D2)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x124D2; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. One-dimensional signed-offset step table for stationary rev-limiter readiness accumulator ffff16a6. Every time timer ffff258a expires, FUN 0004f324 decodes the interpolated byte as x-128, adds it to the accumulator with saturation to 0..65535, and reloads the timer with 100. The lookup coordinate is q=clamp((signed16(ffff11bc)-160)/2,0,255), with signed rounding before division. Current values 128..255 decode to additions of 0..127. ROM16[0000911c] is the inclusive readiness threshold. The physical identity and engineering scale of ffff11bc remain unresolved.</description>
