  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xB362" flags="0x0">
    <title>Knock Sensor Circuit Monitor Surface A (0xABBA)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0xABBA; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Knock Sensor Circuit Monitor Surface A: the first mode surface in the evaluation path for P0327/P0328/P0332/P0333. Output ffff338a scales the monitor metric, participates in accumulation into ffff3334, and reaches diagnostic state byte ffff4204. The surface is selected when byte[ffff3427] &lt;= byte[0x8796], where the ROM threshold is 95. The physical unit of raw and the direction in which increasing a cell affects the final DTC verdict are unknown. Static diagnostic context: DTC P0327 [code, exact_rom]; DTC P0328 [code, exact_rom]; DTC P0332 [code, exact_rom]; DTC P0333 [code, exact_rom].</description>
