  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1E69" flags="0x0">
    <title>Knock Slice Map - active bank (0x1108E)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x1108E; 6 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Knock Slice Map: per-cylinder knock threshold by engine speed. Measured knock strength exceeding the interpolated threshold contributes to increasing the knock count. 00049ffc selects a cylinder row, interpolates 16 uint16 points along axis 0x15340, and stores the threshold for comparison in 0004a238. Value 0xffff is the uint16 upper bound and makes exceeding the threshold practically impossible.</description>
