    <title>Filter Weight - new-sample share Q16 (0x14E52)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x14E52; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. New-value weight of a first-order lag filter Semantic confidence: candidate. Blocking condition: The complete code trace is not confirmed by the blind artifact. Kernel 00026a64 listing ends immediately after cell reads 00026aa0/00026aa2 and does not show calculation or return of r0 for branch param_2 &lt; 0xf000. The stated formula is also presented as final y, although after blending code executes branch 00064a74..00064a9a: if the truncated result is below the current value and equals the previous state, it is incremented by 1. Neither the raw source on every branch nor the exact stated result semantics are independently proven. Scale confidence: code. Scale: x/65536; inverse encoding: x*65536; units: Q16 fraction (0..1). Scale trace: 00064a32 loads target-map base 00014e52 and 00064a40 calls its 1D wrapper 000263f4. The index input is limited to an unsigned byte shifted by 8; the wrapper branch for value &gt;= 0xf000 returns the last uint16 cell, while the kernel branch reads adjacent uint16 cells at 00026aa0/00026aa2. The result returns in r0, is zero-extended as uint16 into r2 at 00064a44, and stored in RAM ffff1608 at 00064a4a. The same r2 is copied without conversion to r5 at 00064a6c and used as a coefficient inside 00064a1c: 00064a6e calculates current*raw; 00064a70/00064a74 forms 0x10000; 00064a76 calculates 0x10000-raw; 00064a7a calculates previous*(0x10000-raw); 00064a7e adds the products; the final expression is shifted right by 16. The contribution of current is therefore raw/65536 and that of previous is 1-raw/65536. After extu.w, raw is 0..65535, giving physical coefficient 0..65535/65536.</description>
