  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x99B2" flags="0x0">
    <title>Conditional Blend Reference - raw u16 (0x14CEA)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x14CEA; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. Interpolated uint16 output is written to ffff1910 and serves as a reference operand in branch-dependent blending with output of map 0000e98e inside FUN_00075c48. Physical semantics are unknown. All 16 cells equal 0xffff, but constancy does not prove purpose. After the write to ffff1910, the value conditionally participates in blending with result 0000e98e; contract 00021bbc confirms only signed division. Offset 0x8000, conditional blending, and saturation define no exact invertible physical scale. The axis is implicit and has no separate Axis claim. Blocking condition: The external trace stops at site 00075d28, which writes the result to ffff1910; ffff1910 has no external readers. The internal trace in 00075c48 reaches only conditional arithmetic and function 00021bbc, which reveal no physical quantity or units. Promotion rejected: Exact write attribution in /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-isrudoy-src-docs-vq/d31db600-b7d4-488a-b83b-86388fed907c/scratchpad/sweep-p260-289/map-00014cea.md is confirmed: 00075d1a loads base 00014cea, 00075d1e calls wrapper 000263f4, 00075d22 moves r0 to r2, and 00075d28 writes the low word to ffff1910. The second call is separately bound to 0000e98e at 00075d26 and 00075d38. The 1D-16 uint16 shape and adjacent-word reads at 00026aa0 and 00026aa2 confirm role=table. Local read/write consumption of ffff1910 inside FUN_00075c48 confirms disposition=consumer; absence of external readers does not contradict this. Code confidence and stated arithmetic nevertheless lack a complete machine trace. The unannotated kernel 00026a64 listing ends at 00026aa2 immediately after reading two cells, without interpolation, a finisher, construction of r0, or return. The consumer listing ends at 00075d76 before the actual read of ffff1910, register preparation, call to 00021bbc, and final blend. Contract 00021bbc confirms only signed division r1/r0; without the missing region, it does not link operands to the two map outputs. C pseudocode does not replace a machine trace, especially under the helper calling convention described in the artifact. The wrapper also has a separate endpoint path for input &gt;= 0xf000, so 'interpolated' is not proven on every branch. No separate scale or scale evidence is claimed. Result disposition: consumer.</description>
