  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x260F" flags="0x0">
    <title>Protected Division Denominator - catalog torque-ratio scale (0x15770)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x15770; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. The interpolated uint16 output is written to ffff19a2 and used as a zero-protected divisor for call 00021bbc in the seven shown consumers. Range 1024..1884, monotonic decrease toward 1024, an implicit normalized axis, and use of the result as a divisor are consistent with two catalog variants of Torque Converter Torque Ratio Table. Code proves the full chain to arithmetic consumption but does not identify the physical input ratio or consumer quantities, so the claim and scale remain candidate. The artifact has no separately addressable axis. Blocking condition: The trace stops at 00021bbc: consumers 00074b04, 00075306, 000718d8, 00071a10, 00071b7e, 0007654c, and 000ceabc prove use of ffff19a2 as a zero-protected divisor, but the artifact does not link the numerators or division results to torque and torque-converter speeds. Physical semantics and multiplier 0.000976563 are confirmed only by the catalog. Promotion rejected: Attribution is supported by the machine chain: 000751f6 loads address 00015770 into r4, 000751fc calls table wrapper 000263f4, 00075200 copies return value r0, and 00075204 writes a word to ffff19a2. The table-wrapper call and reads of adjacent uint16 cells at 00026aa0 and 00026aa2 confirm role=table. Disposition=consumer is supported by the structural set of seven ffff19a2 readers. The promoted semantics and its code evidence are disproven: the kernel listing ends immediately after reading two cells and does not show interpolation arithmetic through r0, while machine listings for the seven consumers are absent. Because of the nonstandard register contract, the shown C pseudocode does not reconstruct arguments to 00021bbc by itself. In five pseudocode listings, ffff19a2 appears only in a zero test, while in 00074b04 and 0007654c it appears in neither pseudocode nor expression tables. Those two functions show 000224fa before 00021bbc, so the artifact does not establish whether the divisor is the raw output, its shifted derivative, or another quantity. A complete machine trace for all seven consumers is absent. No separate scale or scale evidence is claimed. Result disposition: consumer.</description>
