    <title>Initial Retard Quantity - unresolved mode (0x11F6A)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x11F6A; 1 rows x 4 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. Initial retard quantity for transient ignition correction, without identifying a specific mode The candidate belongs to the Initial Retard Quantity family in Ignition Timing/Transient Correction/Main, but code does not distinguish the Fuel Cut, Lock-Up, or Stepping on from Idle mode. The result is written to ffff1394 and read again inside 0007b650; there is no visible inline comparison or returned value, and branch unreachability has not been proven. The Degrees scale with factor 1 comes only from five catalog matches. Blocking condition: After ffff1394 is read at 0007b6c2, the shown listing ends at 0007b6c8; subsequent use of r6 and the exact site that passes the quantity to 00021ce0 are absent. Contract 00021ce0 proves only unsigned division and does not establish physical semantics; the five catalog variants remain indistinguishable. Result disposition: writes.</description>
