  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x3374" flags="0x0">
    <title>Local Correction Coefficient /2048 (0x12126)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x12126; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Unsigned local-correction coefficient: on branch r5&gt;=r7, lookup result x in r4 multiplies nonnegative difference r5-r7, after which 0002251c forms floor((r5-r7)*x/2048). The physical name of the quantity is not proven. The formula is proven for branch r5&gt;=r7; the listing of the second branch is available only through 0003c56a, so the claim does not generalize it to r5&lt;r7. Numeric scale round trip: 5 -&gt; 0.00244140625 -&gt; 5; 12 -&gt; 0.005859375 -&gt; 12. Index: implicit 1D-8: r5=uint8[ffff1170]; for r5&lt;224, adjacent uint8 cells are interpolated; for r5&gt;=224, cell 7 is returned. Result disposition: consumer (site 0003c556).</description>
