  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x2B3" flags="0x0">
    <title>Shared Saturated Calculation Multiplier - raw u8 (0x1296C)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x1296C; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Eight-point table of a raw unsigned multiplier. The result interpolated by byte ffff106f forms ffff1766 directly or after conditional normalization; 0006e490 uses this byte as a multiplier of ROM_u16[000093c8] in a constrained fixed-point calculation for ffff1300, while 0006e442 uses it in a division conversion with addition of 0x32 and saturation to 0xff for ffff1f86. The physical subsystem and physical unit are unknown. When RAM[ffff244f]&amp;2 != 0, the lookup result reaches ffff1766 directly. When the bit is zero and RAM[ffff16b1] != 0, min(255, floor(lookup*RAM[ffff16ae]/RAM[ffff16b1])) is written; when the divisor is zero, 255 is written regardless of the map. 0006e490 calculates min(65535, (1250*min(4*ROM_u16[000093c8]*RAM_u8[ffff1766], 0x00346dc5)) &gt;&gt; 16) and writes the result to ffff1300. The claim relies on associated sink 0006e3d8/ffff1766 rather than other accessor registers. Index: x = uint8(RAM[ffff106f]); 8 implicit nodes 0,32,64,96,128,160,192,224; linear interpolation of adjacent uint8 cells for x &lt; 224, and cell 7 is returned for x &gt;= 224. Output trace: 0001296c -&gt; site 0006e3ec -&gt; 00026370 -&gt; (00026a80 -&gt; 00026740 for x &lt; 0xe0; 00012973 for x &gt;= 0xe0) -&gt; site 0006e3f2 -&gt; site 0006e440 -&gt; RAM ffff1766 -&gt; {0006e490 -&gt; RAM ffff1300; 0006e442 -&gt; RAM ffff1f86}. Alternate normalization branch: 0001296c -&gt; site 0006e40a -&gt; 00026370 -&gt; 00026a80 -&gt; 00026740 -&gt; site 0006e41a -&gt; site 0006e426/00021bbc -&gt; site 0006e440 -&gt; RAM ffff1766. Result disposition: consumer; Result target: RAM ffff1766 at site 0006e440; consumers 0006e490 and 0006e442; downstream RAM ffff1300 and ffff1f86. Static diagnostic context: Engine Coolant Temperature [code, homologous_community, via map evidence: indexed_by].</description>
