  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xE8D2" flags="0x0">
    <title>Unresolved RAM ffff1f78 Value - raw u8 (0x12A3A)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x12A3A; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. One-dimensional eight-element uint8 table with an implicit index from RAM byte ffff1077; the lookup result is linearly interpolated and written as a byte to ffff1f78. The physical purpose is unknown. All eight cells equal 0, so the lookup result is 0 for every input, but flat content does not by itself prove the purpose. The map has no separate calibration axis. Index: implicit u8: x=RAM[ffff1077]; for x&lt;224, i=x&gt;&gt;5 and q=(x&amp;31)*2048 in Q0.16, and the result is linear interpolation of map[i] and map[i+1]; for x&gt;=224, map[7] is selected. Output trace: 0003a76c[00012a3a-&gt;r4] -&gt; 0003a76e/0003a774[RAM ffff1077-&gt;u8 r5] -&gt; 0003a772[00026370] -&gt; (x&lt;224: 00026a80 -&gt; 00026aac/00026aae -&gt; 00026ab6 -&gt; 00026740; x&gt;=224: map[7] in 00026370) -&gt; 0003a776[r0-&gt;r2] -&gt; 0003a780[r2-&gt;RAM ffff1f78]; ffff1f78 has no readers. Result disposition: writes; Result target: ffff1f78. Evidence boundary: At 0003a780, the result is only written to ffff1f78; the artifact contains no read of ffff1f78, and 0003a750 is a root with no call sites. A machine trace from the sink to a physical consumer is absent, so the purpose and physical units are not established.</description>
