  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x3157" flags="0x0">
    <title>Composite Output Coefficient K - raw u8 (0x12A82)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x12A82; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Unsigned eight-point coefficient table K for a calculated expression in 000532ae: interpolated K is written to ffff1601 and conditionally participates both in term 256*K and in difference K - 2*C before ffff1600 is formed. The physical name of the coefficient is unknown. On a conditional branch in 000532ae, value K from ffff1601 enters expression iVar12 = 256*K - B*(K - 2*C) + 2*(D*E + F), where B = uint8 ffff15df, C = int8 ffff1660, D = uint8 ffff193d, E = uint8 ffff1680, and F = uint16 ffff2ff0. The sign of iVar12 and subsequent scaling determine the byte written to ffff1600 with saturation to 255. Index: Implicit uniform 1D-8 axis over uint8 from ffff106f: raw points 0, 32, 64, 96, 128, 160, 192, 224; adjacent cells are linearly interpolated, and input &gt;= 224 selects the last cell. Output trace: 00012a82 -&gt; 00052f1e -&gt; 00052f28 -&gt; 00026370 -&gt; 00026a80 -&gt; 00026740 -&gt; 00052f30 -&gt; ffff1601 -&gt; 000532ae -&gt; ffff1600. Result disposition: consumer; Result target: 000532ae. Static diagnostic context: Engine Coolant Temperature [code, homologous_community, via map evidence: indexed_by].</description>
