  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x8489" flags="0x0">
    <title>State Transition Initial Value - raw u8 (0x12AB2)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x12AB2; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. Eight-point unsigned interpolated table of an initial byte value during internal state transition 0 -&gt; 1; the result is written to RAM ffff1f81, and the physical quantity is unknown. The map has eight uint8 cells 30,30,20,14,14,10,10,10. The lookup executes on the branch for internal state transition 0 -&gt; 1 and writes the result to associated sink ffff1f81. Other registers in this accessor are not used to infer semantics. There is no explicit ROM axis, so axes is empty. Catalog shape 1D-8 is ambiguous and does not identify the physical quantity. Index: x=u8[ffff1078]; for x&lt;224: i=floor(x/32), Q0.16 fraction=(x%32)*2048, linear interpolation of table[i]..table[i+1]; for x&gt;=224: table[7]. Output trace: 0003bdc4 -&gt; 0003bdc8 -&gt; 00026370 -&gt; 00026a80 -&gt; 00026aac/00026aae -&gt; 00026740 -&gt; 0003bdcc -&gt; 0003bdd4 -&gt; RAM ffff1f81; stop: no read site for ffff1f81. Result disposition: writes; Result target: RAM ffff1f81, 1 byte, site 0003bdd4. Evidence boundary: After the byte write at site 0003bdd4 to RAM ffff1f81, the artifact contains no machine read site or USES edge for this sink. ffff1f81 is not read within 0003bd74, and there are no external consumers, so the trace does not reach functional consumption of the quantity.</description>
