  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x776D" flags="0x0">
    <title>Three-Factor Product Multiplier B Q1.7 (0x12DCA)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x12DCA; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. 1D table of an unsigned normalized coefficient selected by byte ffff106f. Interpolated value t is stored in ffff1a1f, then multiplied within 0004ac7a by the result of constant map 000129ca and by a quantity in r14 previously constrained to uint16; after a right shift of 14, ffff14dc is formed. For this ROM, the target map's effective coefficient is t/128. The physical subsystem is unknown. ffff1a1f has no external readers, but the value is not dead: it is read in the same function at site 0004ae32 and first consumed by multiplication at site 0004ae36. Adjacent map 000129ca is constant and returns 128, so the expression with a common shift of 14 gives effective target-map coefficient t/128. Numeric round trip: 102/128=0.796875, 0.796875*128=102; 128/128=1, 1*128=128. For t=102..128 and r14&lt;=65535, downstream uint16 saturation does not alter the result. Index: Implicit eight-point uint8 axis. The unsigned selector is read from ffff106f and passed in r5; for value &gt;=224, the wrapper returns element 7; for a lower value, linear interpolation in kernel 00026a80 is used. The selector's physical unit is unknown. Output trace: 00012dca -&gt; site 0004ae16 -&gt; site 0004ae18 -&gt; 00026370 -&gt; site 00026aac -&gt; site 00026ab6 -&gt; 00026740 -&gt; site 0004ae1c -&gt; site 0004ae26 -&gt; ffff1a1f -&gt; site 0004ae32 -&gt; site 0004ae36 -&gt; site 0004ae3e -&gt; site 0004ae42 -&gt; site 0004ae44 -&gt; site 0004ae46 -&gt; site 0004ae48 -&gt; site 0004ae52 -&gt; ffff14dc. Result disposition: consumer; Result target: site 0004ae36. Static diagnostic context: Engine Coolant Temperature [code, homologous_community, via map evidence: indexed_by].</description>
