  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x850A" flags="0x0">
    <title>Channel 1 Composite Addend - raw u8 (0x12E7A)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x12E7A; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Eight-point uint8 table with an implicit index that produces an additive integer term for an internal result: the interpolated byte is stored in ffff1a7c, then clamp(((uint8)y*65536)+RAM[ffff16ec]-0x00800000, 0, 0x00ffffff) is written to ffff1aa0. The physical name and unit are unknown. The catalog for shape 1D-8 is ambiguous. The 16-bit shift belongs to the internal consumption path; because of the downstream addition and saturation, it is not claimed as an independent invertible physical scale. Axis 00011bdb belongs only to adjacent explicit maps and is not included. The summary output-association row contradicts the machine listing: the listing directly shows both writes of the target-map result. Index: implicit 1D, 8 uint8 cells; input x = uint8(RAM[ffff106f]). For x &lt; 0x00e0, kernel 00026a80 interpolates adjacent bytes through finisher 00026740; for x &gt;= 0x00e0, wrapper 00026370 returns cell 7. There is no explicit ROM axis. Output trace: 00012e7a -&gt; 000be7d6 -&gt; 000be7de -&gt; 00026370 -&gt; 00026a80 -&gt; 00026aac/00026aae -&gt; 00026740 -&gt; 000be7e2 -&gt; 000be7e8 -&gt; ffff1a7c; 000be7e2 -&gt; 000be7e6 -&gt; 000be7ea -&gt; 000be7ee -&gt; 000be7f0 -&gt; 000be7f2 -&gt; 000be7f4/000be7f6/000be7f8 -&gt; 000be7fa/000be7fc/000be7fe/000be800 -&gt; 000be804 -&gt; ffff1aa0. Result disposition: writes; Result target: RAM ffff1a7c (uint8, interpolated byte); RAM ffff1aa0 (uint32, result in range 0..0x00ffffff). Static diagnostic context: Engine Coolant Temperature [code, homologous_community, via map evidence: indexed_by].</description>
