  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x2D06" flags="0x0">
    <title>Conditional Paired State Value A - raw u8 (0x12EFE)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x12EFE; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. Mode-selected eight-point table of a raw byte value with implicit linear interpolation; the result is written to RAM ffff1a1e and mirrored to ffff25ee. Its physical and downstream operational semantics are unknown. The physical quantity is unknown. When bit 0 at address 00008616 equals 1, both accessors select 00012efe; the alternate branch selects adjacent 00012f06. All eight cells equal 5, so the lookup returns raw 5 for every input, but a flat constant does not prove semantics by itself. The result is also mirrored to RAM ffff25ee at 000bdc3c and 000bde94. Index: implicit 1D-8 by uint8 input u: nodes 0, 32, 64, 96, 128, 160, 192, 224; for u &lt; 224, index floor(u/32) and linear Q0.16 interpolation of adjacent uint8 cells; for u &gt;= 224, table[7] is returned. Output trace: 00012efe, pointer load 000bdc14 -&gt; wrapper call 00026370 at 000bdc2a -&gt; kernel 00026a80 -&gt; uint8 cell reads 00026aac/00026aae -&gt; finisher 00026740 -&gt; r0/r6 at 000bdc2e -&gt; RAM ffff1a1e at 000bdc34; 00012efe, pointer load 000bde70 -&gt; wrapper call 00026370 at 000bde82 -&gt; kernel 00026a80 -&gt; uint8 cell reads 00026aac/00026aae -&gt; finisher 00026740 -&gt; r0/r5 at 000bde86 -&gt; RAM ffff1a1e at 000bde8c. Both paths end with a write and no proven downstream consumption. Result disposition: writes; Result target: RAM ffff1a1e, writes 000bdc34 and 000bde8c; mirror RAM ffff25ee, writes 000bdc3c and 000bde94. Evidence boundary: The machine trace ends at RAM ffff1a1e writes at 000bdc34 and 000bde8c. On the first path, 000bdc3a branches unconditionally to 000bdc5c and bypasses the comparison at 000bdc52. On the second path, the result in r5 is overwritten after the write at 000bde9c, while the return from FUN_000bdc66 is not associated with the lookup. The shown read of ffff1a1e inside FUN_000bdc66 precedes the lookup and does not form an intra-call downstream trace. The artifact has no external readers of ffff1a1e.</description>
