  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x5CEA" flags="0x0">
    <title>Signed Difference Multiplier Q0.6 (0x1300E)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x1300E; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Dimensionless 1D table of a Q0.6 coefficient. Lookup by RAM byte ffff106f returns M; the same r6 scales signed difference 4*u16[ffff1046]-u16[ffff1024], forming trunc0((4*u16[ffff1046]-u16[ffff1024])*M/64), whose sign selects the downstream processing branch. There is no separate axis array. The lookup result is mirrored to RAM ffff1ca6 through site 00052328, but this RAM sink has no external readers; the actual code consumer of the same r6 is at site 00052338. For a negative product, site 00052342 adds 63 before the arithmetic shift, so the integer result is rounded toward zero. Downstream limiting and combination are visible in pseudocode but are not part of the invertible cell scale. Numeric round trip: 6 -&gt; 0.09375 -&gt; 6; 32 -&gt; 0.5 -&gt; 32. The artifact does not identify the physical subsystem. Index: implicit 1D-8 by u=uint8[ffff106f]: for u&lt;224, i=floor(u/32), fraction=(u%32)/32, and map[i]..map[i+1] are linearly interpolated; for u&gt;=224, map[7] is selected. Output trace: map 0001300e -&gt; site 0005231a -&gt; site 0005231e -&gt; function 00026370 -&gt; (site 00026a80 -&gt; function 00026740 | saturation return in function 00026370) -&gt; site 00052322 (r0-&gt;r6) -&gt; [site 00052328 -&gt; RAM ffff1ca6; site 00052338 -&gt; site 00052346 -&gt; function 000224fa -&gt; site 0005234a -&gt; site 0005234c]. Result disposition: consumer; Result target: site 00052338 (FUN_000522c4).</description>
