  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xBB68" flags="0x0">
    <title>State Decrease Limit A - raw u16 (0x14304)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x14304; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Unsigned 1D table of quantity m that limits reduction of state ffff17c0. When t&lt;p and bit 0x20 of register ffff2458 is clear, code writes 0 for p&lt;m, otherwise max(t,p-m); p is previous ffff17c0, and t is uint16-saturated value uVar10&lt;&lt;3. On the other branches, m does not affect the write. The map is selected when the low byte of uVar8 lies within inclusive range PTR_DAT_00074fb8[1]..PTR_DAT_00074fb8[0]; the other branch uses adjacent 00014314. The lookup result is copied r0-&gt;r6 at 00074f48 and compared with previous ffff17c0 at 00074f70. ffff17c0 has no external readers, but the write is reachable. The physical quantity and unit are unknown. Index: implicit 1D-8 uint16; idx=(ffff1210&lt;&lt;7)&amp;0xffff when ffff1210&lt;0x0200, otherwise idx=0xffff; 000263d8 returns element 7 for idx&gt;=0xe000, otherwise calls 00026a60 and linear finisher 00026740. Output trace: 00014304 -&gt; 00074e4e -&gt; 00074f36 -&gt; 000263d8 -&gt; (00026a60 -&gt; 00026740 for idx &lt; 0000e000; direct element 7 in 000263d8 otherwise) -&gt; 00074f48 -&gt; 00074f70 -&gt; ffff17c0. Result disposition: writes; Result target: ffff17c0.</description>
