  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xD40F" flags="0x0">
    <title>Composite Product Multiplicand - raw u16 (0x14ED2)</title>
    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x14ED2; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Eight-point uint16 table with an implicit index whose lookup result is a 16-bit multiplicand in a composite calculation: at 000525b0 it is multiplied by the uint8 result of 0000a8ea, the product is shifted right by 7, saturated to 0xffff, and written to ffff1652. The physical quantity, unit, and non-unity scale do not follow from code. ffff1652 already contains the product of outputs from 00014ed2 and 0000a8ea, so its two readers do not isolate the physical meaning of the target map. The implicit map has no separate ROM axis. Index: implicit 1D-8; q=min(RAM16[ffff1222]*32,65535); for q&lt;57344, interpolation is performed through 00026a60 and 00026740; for q&gt;=57344, map[7] is returned. Output trace: 00014ed2 -&gt; 000525a6 -&gt; 000525aa -&gt; 000263d8 -&gt; 00026a60 -&gt; 00026740 -&gt; 000525ae -&gt; 000525b0; product -&gt; 000525b6 -&gt; 000525b8 -&gt; 000525ba -&gt; 000525bc -&gt; 000525be -&gt; 000525c0 -&gt; 000525c2 -&gt; 000525c4 -&gt; 000525cc -&gt; ffff1652; ffff1652 -&gt; 000525d8, 0004e59c. Result disposition: consumer; Result target: site 000525b0.</description>
