    <description>Exact JK08A. Address 0x15630; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Eight-point uint16 fallback source table. Lookup M by uint8[ffff1077]&lt;&lt;8 is used during initialization and selected runtime fallback: init writes ffff1062=min(65535,floor(M*uint8[ffff1160]/512)); runtime writes min(65535,floor(floor(M/4)*uint8[ffff1160]/128)). The runtime map branch is selected when uint8[ffff2804] is zero, when ffff4185 bit 7 is set with nonzero ffff437a, or when ffff4185 bit 6 is set with uint8[ffff2804] below 0x20. The other runtime branch supplies the common result through independent arithmetic and does not read 0x15630. Raw M is written to ffff1e44 and floor(M/4) to ffff1e40; neither scratch sink has an external reader. ffff1062 is consumed as a four-times comparison width by FUN_00039316 and FUN_0003a750. Code proves the fallback-source role and formulas but not the physical quantity. The Cranking Base Fuel Schedule identity and x*0.000488 BFS scale remain catalog candidates. Result disposition: consumer.</description>
